OL,3,ALegoland Windsor evacuated over burst
OL,4,Awater main
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Legoland Windsor attraction has
OL,7,Fclosed abruptly due to a burst water
OL,8,Fmain.
OL,10,FCustomers were told to leave rides and
OL,11,Fexit the resort at about 13:00 BST on
OL,12,FSunday.
OL,14,FThames Water said it had to shut off
OL,15,Fthe damaged main near St Leonards
OL,16,FReservoir to prevent flooding, which
OL,17,Faffected supplies to the theme park.
OL,19,FIt said some local residents had
OL,20,Freportedly suffered flooded gardens and
OL,21,Fit apologised for the disruption.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
