OL,3,ASaudi capital airport hit by second
OL,4,AHouthi strike in two days
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Houthis in Yemen said they were
OL,7,Fbehind the attacks and warned airlines
OL,8,Fand passengers against using Saudi
OL,9,FArabian airports and airspace.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
