OL,3,AUkraine strikes Yandex data centre in
OL,4,Athird attack on Russian tech giant
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth Russia and Ukraine have stepped up
OL,7,Fattacks on infrastructure in recent
OL,8,Fmonths as the war between them
OL,9,Fcontinues in its fifth year following
OL,10,FRussia's full-scale invasion.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
