OL,3,APoland detains man suspected of
OL,4,Aplanning assassination of PM Tusk
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoland's Prime Minister Donald Tusk
OL,7,Fsaid a man accused of plotting an
OL,8,Fassassination attack against him and
OL,9,Fhis defence minister has been detained.
OL,11,FThe interior ministry earlier reported
OL,12,Fthat police had received credible
OL,13,Finformation about possible attacks
OL,14,Fagainst Tusk and Wladyslaw
OL,15,FKosiniak-Kamysz.
OL,17,FPolish security services convened a
OL,18,Fspecial meeting on Sunday after
OL,19,Freceiving information about the planned
OL,20,Fattacks, with a spokesman saying
OL,21,Fofficials were treating the threat as
OL,22,F"deadly serious".
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
